The populations of healthy (counts on selective media) and culturable (counts on selective media) cells were modelled using Eqs. (3) and (4), respectively, based on the log-linear inactivation model of Akkermans et al.26 extended with a Bigelow-type temperature dependency. Similar to the modelling of the inactivation kinetics, the specific temperature profile, the initial cell density prior to the treatment, and the resulting cell density following the treatment for each sample time and replicate were separately taken into account to determine the parameters of the SI model.3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
